    <data key="d0">Sunday Sky Rendering Ecosystem</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6CgqEzyWpeA</data>
    <data key="d2">Video rendering as a service architecture using spot instances and automated scaling.</data>
